#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:4
msgid "Kubernetes Storage Management"
msgstr "Gestion du stockage Kubernetes"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Vue d'ensemble"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:9
msgid ""
"The Storage tab on a Kubernetes Cluster detail page provides management "
"of persistent storage resources within the cluster. |morpheus| syncs and "
"manages StorageClasses, Persistent Volumes (PVs), Persistent Volume "
"Claims (PVCs), ConfigMaps, and Secrets."
msgstr "L'onglet Storage de la page de détail d'un cluster Kubernetes permet de gérer les ressources de stockage persistant dans le cluster. |morpheus| synchronise et gère les StorageClasses, Persistent Volumes (PV), Persistent Volume Claims (PVC), ConfigMaps et Secrets."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:11
msgid ""
"Navigate to the Storage tab via ``Infrastructure > Clusters > [cluster "
"name] > Storage``."
msgstr "Accédez à l'onglet Storage via ``Infrastructure > Clusters > [cluster name] > Storage``."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:13
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Note"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:13
msgid ""
"Storage management requires ``Infrastructure: Clusters > Full`` Role "
"permission."
msgstr "La gestion du stockage nécessite l'autorisation de rôle ``Infrastructure: Clusters > Full``."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:16
msgid "Storage Classes"
msgstr "Classes de stockage"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:18
msgid ""
"StorageClasses define the types of storage available in the cluster. They"
" map to provisioners (e.g., OpenEBS, Rook/Ceph, AWS EBS, vSphere volumes)"
" and define parameters for dynamically provisioned volumes."
msgstr "Les StorageClasses définissent les types de stockage disponibles dans le cluster. Elles correspondent aux provisionneurs (par ex. OpenEBS, Rook/Ceph, AWS EBS, volumes vSphere) et définissent les paramètres pour les volumes provisionnés dynamiquement."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:21
msgid "Viewing Storage Classes"
msgstr "Consultation des classes de stockage"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:23
msgid ""
"The Storage Classes subtab displays all StorageClasses synced from the "
"cluster, including:"
msgstr "Le sous-onglet Storage Classes affiche toutes les StorageClasses synchronisées depuis le cluster, notamment :"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:25
msgid "**NAME** — StorageClass name"
msgstr "**NAME** — Nom de la StorageClass"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:26
msgid ""
"**PROVISIONER** — The storage provisioner (e.g., ``kubernetes.io/no-"
"provisioner``, ``openebs.io/local``, ``rook-ceph.rbd.csi.ceph.com``)"
msgstr "**PROVISIONER** — Le provisionneur de stockage (par ex. ``kubernetes.io/no-provisioner``, ``openebs.io/local``, ``rook-ceph.rbd.csi.ceph.com``)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:27
msgid ""
"**RECLAIM POLICY** — What happens to PVs when released (``Retain``, "
"``Delete``, ``Recycle``)"
msgstr "**RECLAIM POLICY** — Ce qui arrive aux PV lors de leur libération (``Retain``, ``Delete``, ``Recycle``)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:28
msgid ""
"**VOLUME BINDING MODE** — When volume binding occurs (``Immediate``, "
"``WaitForFirstConsumer``)"
msgstr "**VOLUME BINDING MODE** — Quand la liaison de volume a lieu (``Immediate``, ``WaitForFirstConsumer``)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:29
msgid "**DEFAULT** — Whether this is the cluster's default StorageClass"
msgstr "**DEFAULT** — S'il s'agit de la StorageClass par défaut du cluster"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:31
msgid "Important"
msgstr "Important"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:31
msgid ""
"When using |morpheus| Kubernetes clusters with OpenEBS, ensure a default "
"StorageClass is available so that Kubernetes specs or Helm templates "
"using a default StorageClass for PVCs can be utilized."
msgstr "Lors de l'utilisation de clusters Kubernetes |morpheus| avec OpenEBS, assurez-vous qu'une StorageClass par défaut est disponible afin que les specs Kubernetes ou les modèles Helm utilisant une StorageClass par défaut pour les PVC puissent être utilisés."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:34
msgid "Persistent Volumes (PVs)"
msgstr "Persistent Volumes (PV)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:36
msgid ""
"Persistent Volumes represent physical storage resources in the cluster "
"that have been provisioned by an administrator or dynamically provisioned"
" using a StorageClass."
msgstr "Les Persistent Volumes représentent les ressources de stockage physiques du cluster qui ont été provisionnées par un administrateur ou provisionnées dynamiquement à l'aide d'une StorageClass."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:39
msgid "Viewing Persistent Volumes"
msgstr "Consultation des Persistent Volumes"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:41
msgid "The Volumes subtab shows:"
msgstr "Le sous-onglet Volumes affiche :"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:43
msgid "**NAME** — PV name"
msgstr "**NAME** — Nom du PV"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:44
msgid "**CAPACITY** — Storage size (e.g., ``10Gi``)"
msgstr "**CAPACITY** — Taille de stockage (par ex. ``10Gi``)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:45
msgid ""
"**ACCESS MODES** — ``ReadWriteOnce``, ``ReadOnlyMany``, or "
