#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:81
msgid "Deleting Persistent Volumes"
msgstr "Suppression de Persistent Volumes"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:83
msgid "Deleting a PV from |morpheus|:"
msgstr "Suppression d'un PV depuis |morpheus| :"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:85
msgid "Select the PV from the Volumes list"
msgstr "Sélectionnez le PV dans la liste Volumes"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:86
msgid "Click :guilabel:`DELETE`"
msgstr "Cliquez sur :guilabel:`DELETE`"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:87
msgid "Confirm deletion"
msgstr "Confirmez la suppression"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:89
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Avertissement"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:89
msgid ""
"Deleting a PV that is bound to a PVC will first delete the associated "
"claim. Use the ``Orphan`` propagation policy to retain the underlying "
"storage data."
msgstr "La suppression d'un PV lié à un PVC supprimera d'abord la revendication associée. Utilisez la politique de propagation ``Orphan`` pour conserver les données de stockage sous-jacentes."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:92
msgid "Persistent Volume Claims (PVCs)"
msgstr "Persistent Volume Claims (PVC)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:94
msgid ""
"PVCs are requests for storage by a user. They consume PV resources and "
"are namespace-scoped."
msgstr "Les PVC sont des demandes de stockage par un utilisateur. Ils consomment des ressources PV et sont limités à un espace de noms."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:97
msgid "Viewing Volume Claims"
msgstr "Consultation des revendications de volume"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:99
msgid "The Volume Claims subtab displays:"
msgstr "Le sous-onglet Volume Claims affiche :"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:101
msgid "**NAME** — Claim name"
msgstr "**NAME** — Nom de la revendication"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:102
msgid "**NAMESPACE** — Namespace containing the claim"
msgstr "**NAMESPACE** — Espace de noms contenant la revendication"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:103
msgid "**STATUS** — ``Pending``, ``Bound``, or ``Lost``"
msgstr "**STATUS** — ``Pending``, ``Bound`` ou ``Lost``"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:104
msgid "**VOLUME** — The PV bound to this claim"
msgstr "**VOLUME** — Le PV lié à cette revendication"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:105
msgid "**CAPACITY** — Allocated storage size"
msgstr "**CAPACITY** — Taille de stockage allouée"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:106
msgid "**ACCESS MODES** — Requested access modes"
msgstr "**ACCESS MODES** — Modes d'accès demandés"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:107
msgid "**STORAGE CLASS** — Requested StorageClass"
msgstr "**STORAGE CLASS** — StorageClass demandée"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:110
msgid "Creating Volume Claims"
msgstr "Création de revendications de volume"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:112
msgid "To create a PVC:"
msgstr "Pour créer un PVC :"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:114
msgid "Navigate to the Storage tab > Volume Claims subtab"
msgstr "Accédez à l'onglet Storage > sous-onglet Volume Claims"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:119
msgid "Claim name"
msgstr "Nom de la revendication"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:121
msgid "Target namespace for the claim"
msgstr "Espace de noms cible pour la revendication"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:123
msgid "Select a StorageClass (or leave blank for default)"
msgstr "Sélectionnez une StorageClass (ou laissez vide pour la valeur par défaut)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:125
msgid "Requested access mode"
msgstr "Mode d'accès demandé"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:127
msgid "Requested storage size"
msgstr "Taille de stockage demandée"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:131
msgid ""
"|morpheus| creates the PVC in the cluster. If dynamic provisioning is "
"configured for the selected StorageClass, a PV will be automatically "
"created and bound."
msgstr "|morpheus| crée le PVC dans le cluster. Si le provisionnement dynamique est configuré pour la StorageClass sélectionnée, un PV sera automatiquement créé et lié."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:134
msgid "Deleting Volume Claims"
msgstr "Suppression des revendications de volume"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:136
msgid "When deleting a PVC from |morpheus|:"
msgstr "Lors de la suppression d'un PVC depuis |morpheus| :"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:138
msgid "The PVC is removed from the cluster"
msgstr "Le PVC est supprimé du cluster"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:139
msgid "Behavior for the associated PV depends on the ``propagationPolicy``:"
msgstr "Le comportement pour le PV associé dépend de la ``propagationPolicy`` :"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:141
msgid "**Foreground** (default) — Both PVC and PV are deleted"
msgstr "**Foreground** (par défaut) — Le PVC et le PV sont supprimés"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:142
msgid ""
"**Orphan** — Only the PVC is deleted; the PV is retained with a "
"``Released`` status"
msgstr "**Orphan** — Seul le PVC est supprimé ; le PV est conservé avec le statut ``Released``"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:145
msgid "ConfigMaps"
msgstr "ConfigMaps"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:147
msgid ""
"ConfigMaps store non-confidential configuration data as key-value pairs. "
"They are synced and viewable on the Storage tab."
msgstr "Les ConfigMaps stockent des données de configuration non confidentielles sous forme de paires clé-valeur. Elles sont synchronisées et consultables dans l'onglet Storage."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:149
msgid "View existing ConfigMaps per namespace"
msgstr "Consulter les ConfigMaps existants par espace de noms"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:150
msgid "Inspect key-value contents"
msgstr "Inspecter le contenu clé-valeur"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:151
msgid "Create new ConfigMaps with arbitrary key-value data"
msgstr "Créer de nouveaux ConfigMaps avec des données clé-valeur arbitraires"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:154
msgid "Secrets"
msgstr "Secrets"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:156
msgid ""
"Secrets store sensitive data such as passwords, tokens, and keys. They "
"are synced from the cluster and displayed (values are masked by default)."
msgstr "Les Secrets stockent des données sensibles telles que mots de passe, jetons et clés. Ils sont synchronisés depuis le cluster et affichés (les valeurs sont masquées par défaut)."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:158
msgid "View existing Secrets per namespace"
msgstr "Consulter les Secrets existants par espace de noms"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:159
msgid ""
"Secret types include ``Opaque``, ``kubernetes.io/tls``, "
"``kubernetes.io/dockerconfigjson``, etc."
msgstr "Les types de Secret incluent ``Opaque``, ``kubernetes.io/tls``, ``kubernetes.io/dockerconfigjson``, etc."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:160
msgid "Create new Secrets with encoded data"
msgstr "Créer de nouveaux Secrets avec des données encodées"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:163
msgid "Storage Runtime Options"
msgstr "Options de runtime de stockage"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:165
msgid ""
"When provisioning a |morpheus| Kubernetes cluster, the storage runtime is"
" configured via the Cluster Layout:"
msgstr "Lors du provisionnement d'un cluster Kubernetes |morpheus|, le runtime de stockage est configuré via la disposition du cluster :"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:167
msgid ""
"**OpenEBS** — Default for many MKS layouts. Provides local and replicated"
" storage."
msgstr "**OpenEBS** — Par défaut pour de nombreuses dispositions MKS. Fournit un stockage local et répliqué."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:168
msgid ""
"**Rook/Ceph** — Available on VMware Fusion and VMware layouts. Provides "
"distributed block storage."
msgstr "**Rook/Ceph** — Disponible sur les dispositions VMware Fusion et VMware. Fournit un stockage bloc distribué."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:169
msgid ""
"**None** — External clusters or layouts that rely on cloud-native storage"
" (EBS, Azure Disk, etc.)"
msgstr "**None** — Clusters externes ou structures qui s'appuient sur un stockage cloud natif (EBS, Azure Disk, etc.)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:171
msgid ""
"The chosen storage runtime determines which StorageClasses are "
"automatically configured on the cluster."
msgstr "L'environnement d'exécution de stockage choisi détermine quelles StorageClasses sont automatiquement configurées sur le cluster."

